<title>USA: Rolling Meadows Park, Ill., won by Bernardi.</title>
<headline>Rolling Meadows Park, Ill., won by Bernardi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Securities,  Inc. said it won $2.905 million of Rolling Meadows Park Dist., Ill., installment contract certificates, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.62 percent.</p>
</text>
